### Posts ...
#######################

### Get all posts
GET http://localhost:8080/chronicles
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Create a new post
POST http://localhost:8080/chronicles
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "a new post",
  "text": "Lorem Ipsum"
}

